WEBVTT

00:12.970 --> 00:18.710
Hikari ga sasu sora, umareochiru kage
In the bright sky illuminated by
sunlight, darkened shadows are born.

00:18.810 --> 00:24.150
Unmei wa dokomademo hikisakareru
Fate itself is being torn apart.

00:25.190 --> 00:30.150
Donna toki mo kesshite akiramenainara
If you never give up, no matter what happens,

00:30.330 --> 00:37.560
mada tozasareteru tobira kanarazu hiraku
Even that locked door will open for you.

00:38.530 --> 00:43.990
Eien datte dakishimete, fuuin mo tokihanachi
Embrace eternity and release the seal.

00:44.070 --> 00:49.940
Mamorubekimono ga ima kokoni wa arukara
Because the ones you wish
to protect are right here.

00:49.940 --> 00:55.880
Namida mo gyutto dakishimete,
yasashisa de tsutsumikomi
Embrace their tears with kindness.

00:55.880 --> 01:01.560
Nagareru mizu no youni tsuyoku nare
Become strong like the formless water,

01:01.560 --> 01:07.550
omouyouni tsuyoku nare
Become as strong as you wish to be.

01:07.700 --> 01:13.170
Mou jibun ni obienaide
Stop being afraid of yourself.

01:13.170 --> 01:19.800
Sou mirai wo osorenaide
Do not fear the future.

01:33.190 --> 01:35.680
Plushy Park!

01:50.640 --> 01:52.830
Do you know where my rag went?

01:53.110 --> 01:54.670
It's on your desk.

01:57.550 --> 01:58.450
What about my school shoes?

01:58.450 --> 01:59.610
By the front door.

01:59.880 --> 02:03.380
I thought I told him to get everything
ready before going to sleep last night.

02:03.380 --> 02:05.880
What is the matter with Toru-sama?

02:06.960 --> 02:09.990
The new term for his school is starting.

02:09.990 --> 02:11.020
Well, same for me, too.

02:13.630 --> 02:14.790
School?

02:15.530 --> 02:20.490
Our Fox Deity, Goes to School

02:25.410 --> 02:27.430
Akagi High School

02:38.720 --> 02:39.780
Wait, no...

02:41.090 --> 02:41.990
Takagami.

02:45.990 --> 02:46.960
Sakura...

02:47.660 --> 02:50.200
I thought you were in Class 4.

02:50.200 --> 02:52.470
I-I was visiting a friend.

02:52.470 --> 02:55.470
Anyway, what's wrong?
You had a scowl on your face.

02:55.470 --> 02:59.100
Huh? Oh, it's nothing, really.

03:00.710 --> 03:03.970
Dad's still at work and Toru has school until noon...

03:04.310 --> 03:06.840
Only Ku and Ko are home right now...

03:07.080 --> 03:08.350
Will they be okay?

03:08.350 --> 03:10.280
They better not have left the fridge open.

03:10.390 --> 03:12.850
No, I told them not to, so it should be okay!

03:12.850 --> 03:15.250
The tap! They might've left the water running.

03:15.560 --> 03:16.490
No!

03:16.490 --> 03:19.320
I taught them everything! It should be okay!

03:37.680 --> 03:40.910
Next up, we have an exclusive report
on this summer's fashion trends.

03:41.250 --> 03:43.080
We will have a lot of sunny days this season.

03:43.520 --> 03:47.550
And at our first store, they have a design
at the forefront of this summer's fashion.

03:47.890 --> 03:50.830
For today, we will show what kind
of school lunches are being served.

03:50.830 --> 03:52.020
Now don't they look delicious?

03:52.230 --> 03:53.990
School...

03:54.730 --> 03:59.100
Now that they mention it, Miyako left
the Mizuchi household to attend school...

04:01.640 --> 04:03.370
A school...

04:05.510 --> 04:06.870
I'm home!

04:07.380 --> 04:08.340
I'm home!

04:08.340 --> 04:09.810
Hey, that was quick.

04:10.080 --> 04:11.770
We only had the opening ceremony today.

04:12.350 --> 04:13.370
Are you hungry?

04:13.880 --> 04:17.210
Wait just a second. We have
some riceballs Noboru made.

04:23.420 --> 04:26.060
Ko-chan... What happened here?

04:26.060 --> 04:29.630
It went slip and bubble and...

04:29.630 --> 04:30.690
Uh-huh...

04:31.100 --> 04:33.120
It's kind of dangerous, so lemme go get a broom.

04:35.800 --> 04:36.930
There we go.

04:42.510 --> 04:43.200
Toru.

04:43.910 --> 04:45.240
Just a sec.

04:45.580 --> 04:47.950
What do you do at the place called school?

04:50.020 --> 04:52.420
Uhh, study.

04:52.420 --> 04:53.390
Who studies?

04:53.760 --> 04:57.190
Me, Noboru, and other kids, I think.

04:57.190 --> 04:59.030
What do you study?

04:59.030 --> 05:02.100
Like... Japanese, arithmetic, and...

05:02.100 --> 05:03.090
What happens if you study?

05:03.870 --> 05:05.160
What happens?

05:05.400 --> 05:07.990
Uhh, I don't know.

05:09.000 --> 05:10.800
I still don't understand it.

05:18.180 --> 05:20.740
Takagami
Sugino

05:27.590 --> 05:28.850
I got you now!

05:29.160 --> 05:30.850
Eat this! The roar of my soul!

05:35.900 --> 05:37.130
I win!

05:37.230 --> 05:38.700
You owe me a coke, Takagami-kun!

05:45.740 --> 05:48.570
Seems like Sugino won today.

05:48.680 --> 05:49.370
Yeah...

05:50.180 --> 05:54.310
You looked really out of it. What happened?

05:54.520 --> 05:58.080
You're not yourself today.
Did something happen during break?

05:59.520 --> 06:04.290
I can't say we were attacked
by a yokai and ended up...

06:04.290 --> 06:06.560
...living with a talking fox and a Mamorime.

06:07.500 --> 06:08.520
Nothing.

06:09.560 --> 06:10.720
Oh...

06:11.430 --> 06:16.370
How's your new class?
I don't know anyone in mine...

06:16.640 --> 06:18.400
It's okay, I guess.

06:18.870 --> 06:19.770
Oh...

06:21.440 --> 06:25.310
Don't you think it's gotten really warm?
The weather's so nice today!

06:25.910 --> 06:26.780
Yeah, I guess.

06:27.010 --> 06:29.210
Warm? The weather?

06:29.480 --> 06:34.350
The laundry! Ko better not have
washed the whites with the colors.

06:34.520 --> 06:37.930
Did you know? This really nice
ice cream store opened recently.

06:37.930 --> 06:43.900
Ice cream! The freezer! I told them
about the fridge, but not the freezer.

06:43.900 --> 06:47.430
This is bad! Only Ku and Ko are home right now!

06:47.800 --> 06:52.270
S-So, if you'd like, why don't we go together and...

06:52.270 --> 06:53.270
Together!

06:53.270 --> 06:55.370
Y-Yeah, together and...

06:56.210 --> 06:57.470
Now I'm really worried!

06:57.810 --> 06:59.710
So after the club meeting is over, we can...

07:00.210 --> 07:01.310
We're going now?!

07:01.450 --> 07:02.580
Takagami!

07:02.920 --> 07:03.680
Teraoka?

07:06.420 --> 07:10.650
Huge! Blonde! Looking for you! Blond! G-G-Girl!

07:10.790 --> 07:12.950
Calm down. I don't know what you're talking about.

07:13.390 --> 07:18.130
There's a blonde girl! This beautiful
blonde foreign girl is looking for you!

07:39.720 --> 07:41.650
J-Just a little more...

07:41.960 --> 07:42.720
I can almost...

07:43.220 --> 07:44.120
Wow!

07:44.390 --> 07:45.450
Who's that?

07:45.790 --> 07:46.760
Whoops!

07:57.440 --> 07:58.530
Otsuka!

08:03.510 --> 08:05.000
This game's too easy.

08:06.250 --> 08:07.770
That was amazing, Ku-chan.

08:08.080 --> 08:10.070
Awesome!

08:10.380 --> 08:11.750
Ku! Toru!

08:12.050 --> 08:13.110
Takagami?

08:13.490 --> 08:15.510
What are you doing here?!

08:15.860 --> 08:18.090
Ku-chan said she wanted to see the school.

08:18.230 --> 08:20.220
I wanted to know what kind of place it is.

08:21.900 --> 08:23.630
What about Ko? Isn't she with you?

08:24.100 --> 08:28.230
Well, we were together when
we got off the bus, but...

08:32.140 --> 08:33.570
A shrine maiden?

08:33.670 --> 08:35.400
Is she real? It's first time I ever saw one!

08:35.680 --> 08:37.450
There she is.

08:37.450 --> 08:38.880
Get down from there right now!

08:39.650 --> 08:40.380
Understood.

08:43.820 --> 08:45.990
How'd she get on top of the backboard?

08:45.990 --> 08:50.090
I rode on this "hus" since Toru-sama ordered me to.

08:50.090 --> 08:54.320
But as a Mamorime, I shouldn't walk alongside
a member of the main family in public.

08:54.600 --> 08:57.160
Can you please just act normal?!

08:57.330 --> 08:58.100
Understood.

08:58.100 --> 08:59.930
So what happened on the bus?

09:00.670 --> 09:02.070
She was on the rack.

09:02.640 --> 09:03.800
I knew it...

09:04.070 --> 09:06.470
And you! What's with that outfit?!

09:07.070 --> 09:10.710
Isn't this nice? I saw it on TV.

09:10.710 --> 09:12.580
It's the forefront of this year's summer fashion.

09:12.710 --> 09:14.580
You're going way overboard!

09:14.580 --> 09:17.690
Come on. I want to see what school's like.

09:17.690 --> 09:19.720
Take me around!

09:19.720 --> 09:21.020
No! Go home!

09:21.260 --> 09:23.990
Then we'll just have wasted
money on the bus ticket.

09:24.490 --> 09:26.360
No means no!

09:26.360 --> 09:27.800
You heard him, Ku-chan.

09:27.800 --> 09:28.420
No way!

09:28.660 --> 09:33.120
Oh, well. Let's just go home
and eat something nice.

09:33.300 --> 09:36.290
I know. We still had some pancake mix at home!

09:36.370 --> 09:38.030
Pancake mix?

09:38.210 --> 09:39.470
Pancakes...

09:39.470 --> 09:42.080
Frying pan... Oil...

09:42.080 --> 09:46.380
Gas... Explosion... Fire... Family budget...

09:46.380 --> 09:47.870
Bankruptcy!

09:48.020 --> 09:49.310
Hold on!

09:52.320 --> 09:55.360
Fine. You can stay. But just for today.

09:55.360 --> 09:56.560
Just don't ever...

09:56.560 --> 10:00.190
I knew I could count on you
to be reasonable, Master!

10:00.190 --> 10:01.330
- Ku! Okay! Let me go!

10:01.330 --> 10:03.260
- I love you! Noboru!
- Ku! Okay! Let me go!

10:03.660 --> 10:04.630
Hey! T-Takagami?!

10:04.630 --> 10:06.230
I'm getting kind of...

10:06.230 --> 10:06.330
...jealous.

10:06.330 --> 10:07.490
- You're a genius.
...jealous.

10:07.570 --> 10:09.260
Wh-What's going on?!

10:34.300 --> 10:37.920
Toru! The Mamorime smashed a couple,
so maybe we should take some of these home!

10:38.270 --> 10:39.700
We can't do that, Ku-chan!

10:40.000 --> 10:43.840
Really? I thought Noboru would be
overjoyed at the idea. But whatever.

10:44.610 --> 10:47.510
Come on, people. Let's go to the next place!

10:47.640 --> 10:49.010
Sure thing!

10:49.540 --> 10:52.030
Ku! Toru!

10:53.850 --> 10:55.940
Where did they go?

10:56.580 --> 10:59.390
And what's Sugino and the others' problem?!

10:59.390 --> 11:01.880
They were getting all starry-eyed and stuff!

11:02.720 --> 11:05.090
Sorry for making you come with me, Sakura.

11:05.290 --> 11:08.020
It's not a problem.

11:08.800 --> 11:12.560
But we were supposed to
go eat ice cream together...

11:14.100 --> 11:15.590
She's staying here to study, right?

11:16.570 --> 11:20.060
Uh, yeah. She's homestaying with us.

11:20.840 --> 11:23.330
So she's Ku-san... Tenko Kugen-san...

11:23.740 --> 11:26.610
Now that you mention it, she kind of seems like it.

11:27.180 --> 11:28.270
I wonder if she's German or something.

11:29.220 --> 11:30.550
But still...

11:31.250 --> 11:35.280
Ku!

11:35.620 --> 11:38.490
Where did she go?! Ku!

11:39.190 --> 11:43.600
Why is he so worried about her?

11:44.200 --> 11:49.740
The way he acts around her makes her seem
more than just someone staying at his place.

11:49.740 --> 11:52.000
That... and she's really good with her Japanese.

11:52.740 --> 11:56.230
Could it be they're really pen pal lovers?!

11:56.940 --> 11:59.140
One day, he found a bottle on the beach...

11:59.580 --> 12:01.880
And inside was a memo with her address...

12:02.650 --> 12:04.880
They started exchanging letters...

12:05.220 --> 12:08.060
I can just assume she learned
Japanese from their letters...

12:08.060 --> 12:09.320
And love blossomed!

12:09.560 --> 12:11.590
I guess I've been watching too many soaps.

12:11.590 --> 12:12.320
What if...

12:13.190 --> 12:16.930
Considering her high and mighty attitude,
maybe she's the princess of a certain country!

12:16.930 --> 12:20.740
It was love at first sight with Takagami
and he was forced to get engaged to her!

12:20.740 --> 12:22.970
And Takagami couldn't refuse!

12:22.970 --> 12:24.640
Oh, no! Takagami! Run!

12:24.640 --> 12:27.840
That sort of love isn't real! I'll keep
you safe for the rest of your life!

12:27.840 --> 12:29.810
I'll go out and work to support you...

12:29.810 --> 12:32.640
No! What am I thinking?!

12:33.080 --> 12:33.910
About what?

12:33.910 --> 12:35.940
N-Nothing.

12:38.350 --> 12:41.090
Y-Yeah. I must be overthinking this.

12:41.090 --> 12:43.780
So what if there's a girl by Takagami?

12:47.700 --> 12:50.030
It wasn't just one!

12:50.360 --> 12:52.260
Music Room

12:52.330 --> 12:53.730
Okay, let's do this!

12:59.270 --> 13:01.710
Ku! Toru!

13:02.580 --> 13:04.700
Ku! Toru!

13:06.450 --> 13:09.850
Her name was Ko-san, right?
Is she another foreign student?

13:10.050 --> 13:12.080
But her Japanese is really good, too.

13:12.290 --> 13:14.750
Wait, why is she wearing a shrine maiden outfit?

13:15.120 --> 13:18.990
Maybe she's a relative. But she's calling Takagami
"Noboru-sama"like he's some kind of...

13:19.430 --> 13:22.760
Does that mean she's his fiancée
in an arranged marriage?!

13:22.760 --> 13:26.200
Ko-san could have been told about
Takagami since she was small.

13:26.200 --> 13:28.300
That's why she started harboring feelings
for him and calls him Noboru-sama...

13:28.300 --> 13:31.840
No way! That's like way outdated!

13:31.840 --> 13:32.870
Then what about?!

13:32.870 --> 13:39.010
Takagami is actually a
billionaire and she's his maid?

13:39.010 --> 13:41.920
Maybe that shrine maiden outfit
is just a fetish Takagami has?

13:41.920 --> 13:46.080
So if I started dating Takagami...

13:47.050 --> 13:50.860
I-It's not that I don't want to do it.

13:50.860 --> 13:53.550
To be honest, if he asked me, I'd...

13:53.630 --> 13:56.030
Wait, no!

13:56.360 --> 13:57.900
What's wrong, Sakura?

13:57.900 --> 13:59.530
N-Nothing!

14:04.170 --> 14:05.970
It's so fluffy!

14:05.970 --> 14:07.070
Ku-chan!

14:07.070 --> 14:09.130
Let's get out of here!

14:15.450 --> 14:16.480
- Very nice!

14:16.480 --> 14:17.610
- Can you look this way, please?
- Very nice!

14:17.950 --> 14:20.390
School is so fun!

14:23.420 --> 14:25.290
No point just thinking about it!

14:27.060 --> 14:28.860
Your name is Ko-san, right?

14:28.860 --> 14:29.450
Yes.

14:29.900 --> 14:32.770
I'm Sakura Misaki. Nice to meet you!

14:32.770 --> 14:34.320
Pleased to meet you, too.

14:34.700 --> 14:39.140
So, um... Do you also live with
Ku-san at Takagami's house?

14:39.440 --> 14:40.000
Yes.

14:41.340 --> 14:43.400
Maybe they really are engaged!

14:43.880 --> 14:47.140
Wait, calm down. You have to calm down, Misaki!

14:47.280 --> 14:49.050
Oh, really?

14:49.050 --> 14:53.490
Are you also an exchange student?
Or are you Takagami's relative or something?

14:53.490 --> 14:54.390
I am a Mamorime.

14:54.390 --> 14:57.760
A Mamo... what? What's that?

14:58.330 --> 15:01.020
I protect Noboru-sama and Toru-sama.

15:02.500 --> 15:07.630
I don't really understand.
So what is it that you do?

15:09.370 --> 15:16.000
Things go zip zip, and then Noboru-sama and
Toru-sama go uh-oh, and then I go bash bash.

15:20.080 --> 15:21.410
There they are!

15:27.990 --> 15:30.390
Where are we going next?!

15:36.400 --> 15:38.390
Wait for me, Takagami!

15:38.970 --> 15:41.440
Hey! Where're we going next?

15:41.440 --> 15:44.300
How about our club room for now?

15:44.610 --> 15:48.060
Club room? I don't know what
that is, but it sounds like fun!

15:48.280 --> 15:50.270
Come on! Let's go!

15:50.510 --> 15:51.670
Ku-chan!

15:52.780 --> 15:54.210
Wait for us, Ku-chan!

15:54.820 --> 15:55.980
Wait for me!

15:57.690 --> 15:59.780
Ku! Toru!

16:00.020 --> 16:02.150
Geez! Why don't they notice me?

16:03.720 --> 16:06.120
They're all so hopeless!

16:08.600 --> 16:10.390
Is this a?

16:11.530 --> 16:13.590
I knew it!

16:18.240 --> 16:20.330
Ku!

16:21.840 --> 16:23.280
Ku-chan?

16:23.280 --> 16:24.510
What's the matter?

16:24.650 --> 16:28.600
How could I forget my duty?

16:29.450 --> 16:31.350
Go on ahead. I'll be right back!

16:31.590 --> 16:32.380
Okay!

16:34.660 --> 16:36.990
K-Ko! Sakura!

16:36.990 --> 16:37.960
Noboru-sama!

16:38.290 --> 16:40.120
Takagami! Are you okay?!

16:40.560 --> 16:41.460
Not so good...

16:41.930 --> 16:43.000
Takagami!

16:43.000 --> 16:44.660
Aww, I messed up.

16:45.400 --> 16:47.030
We were so close.

16:47.030 --> 16:48.020
...close.

16:48.240 --> 16:49.220
...close.

17:03.580 --> 17:07.880
We couldn't do anything with the
fox near him. Right, Big Brother?

17:08.190 --> 17:13.020
We were going to pull the Mizuchi
kid into our world. Right, Big Bro?!

17:13.130 --> 17:15.360
Hmph! We let him get away!

17:15.500 --> 17:17.900
Th-They're kids? What's going on?!

17:17.900 --> 17:19.460
Noboru!

17:20.330 --> 17:21.060
Ku!

17:22.040 --> 17:25.440
Mamorime, they're creatures of the earth affinity.

17:25.440 --> 17:27.130
Your water-based spells have no effect on them.

17:27.470 --> 17:29.240
Just stay there and protect Noboru!

17:29.240 --> 17:29.800
Yes!

17:30.840 --> 17:33.010
Your pranks have gone too far, you little brats.

17:33.310 --> 17:36.050
Oh? Looks like the fox is back.

17:36.050 --> 17:37.350
What now, Big Bro?

17:37.350 --> 17:40.510
This will be fun. It's time to fight!

17:51.570 --> 17:52.930
Over here!

17:53.930 --> 17:54.900
Quick little brats...

17:56.070 --> 17:57.770
Over here!

17:57.770 --> 17:58.940
What's a matter, fox?!

17:58.940 --> 18:00.440
Try and catch me!

18:00.440 --> 18:02.580
- Come and catch me!

18:02.580 --> 18:04.200
- Nyaa nyaa!
- Come and catch me!

18:08.320 --> 18:11.610
Stay still!

18:12.220 --> 18:13.880
Over here!

18:14.820 --> 18:17.460
What's a matter, fox?!

18:17.460 --> 18:18.390
Try and catch me!

18:19.930 --> 18:20.660
Ku.

18:24.800 --> 18:27.100
I caught the fox!

18:27.330 --> 18:28.600
You look so stupid!

18:30.640 --> 18:32.730
I'll show you!

18:33.670 --> 18:35.470
What now?!

19:15.850 --> 19:18.340
Wood parts the earth. Well done.

19:18.550 --> 19:20.450
This is nothing but a stupid game.

19:20.750 --> 19:21.410
And you three!

19:22.660 --> 19:23.550
Say your names!

19:23.890 --> 19:24.930
Mogukazu!

19:24.930 --> 19:25.590
Mogutsugu!

19:25.590 --> 19:26.430
Moguzo!

19:26.430 --> 19:26.980
Now begone!

19:29.760 --> 19:31.460
Those brats need to know their place.

19:32.370 --> 19:33.630
Thanks, Ku.

19:33.970 --> 19:36.770
What were they?

19:37.400 --> 19:40.840
This can't be real. What's going on?

19:42.340 --> 19:43.500
I'll take care of it.

19:44.180 --> 19:49.880
I completely lost track of time while
having fun with Ku-san and everyone else.

19:51.590 --> 19:54.580
It was so fun...

19:54.790 --> 19:58.190
Oh, look at the time. I better go home.

19:59.130 --> 20:02.250
You're right. I have to go home...

20:02.900 --> 20:04.300
Home...

20:04.770 --> 20:06.130
Home...

20:06.730 --> 20:07.790
H-Hey.

20:07.970 --> 20:10.640
Don't worry. I didn't erase her memory or anything.

20:10.640 --> 20:12.770
I just buried it deep into her subconscious.

20:12.770 --> 20:16.870
She might remember it as something like a dream.

20:17.480 --> 20:18.340
R-Really?

20:18.650 --> 20:20.010
Trust me.

20:20.010 --> 20:24.150
Now then. Toru's waiting for us
so let's get back to sightseeing.

20:24.150 --> 20:25.920
No. We're going home, too!

20:25.920 --> 20:28.760
What? But the club room!

20:28.760 --> 20:30.480
I said we're going home!

20:31.430 --> 20:33.050
The club room!

20:38.670 --> 20:40.000
What is school?

20:41.640 --> 20:42.870
Well...

20:42.870 --> 20:45.240
Ku-chan, do you understand
what school is about now?

20:45.510 --> 20:46.670
Nope.

20:46.670 --> 20:50.010
Don't understand it at all.
But it was a pretty fun place.

20:50.910 --> 20:53.440
Speaking of which, I didn't try those school lunches.

20:53.780 --> 20:55.480
They don't have those in high school.

20:56.420 --> 20:58.480
But my elementary school does.

20:58.690 --> 21:02.360
All right! Let's go to your school tomorrow, Toru!

21:02.360 --> 21:02.980
No!

21:03.920 --> 21:06.690
I said no!

21:15.340 --> 21:21.800
Sora no hate ga tsunagaru basho wo
Where the horizon meets the earth,

21:22.280 --> 21:29.480
no ni saku hana wa mada kitto shiranai
The flower growing in the wild remains unaware.

21:30.850 --> 21:37.350
Kokoyori ii sekai ga aruto
While thinking that there
is a world better than this.

21:37.490 --> 21:45.130
Kokoro wa itsumo hane wo hirogetagaru
They always desire to spread
the wings of their hearts.

21:46.030 --> 21:53.060
Yume dakede owarasenai
Don't let it end as just a dream,

21:53.640 --> 22:00.140
chansu ga aru hazusa
There's always a chance.

22:00.380 --> 22:07.790
Daijoubu bokura wa hitori janai
It's all right. We are not alone.

22:07.790 --> 22:15.430
Kaze ga nanika wo iouto shiteru
The winds are telling us something.

22:15.430 --> 22:23.100
Daijoubu kanarazu umaku yareru
It's all right. You can do it.

22:23.100 --> 22:34.310
Omoi wa itsuka jibun wo kaeru michi ni naru
Those dreams are a path you'll change yourself.

22:43.620 --> 22:47.590
I didn't find out anything
about those two after all...

22:47.590 --> 22:50.160
Ku-chan and Ko-chan...

22:50.160 --> 22:51.700
They were so pretty.

22:51.700 --> 22:54.960
That Takagami is such a lucky bastard.

22:55.040 --> 22:57.370
Did you see that? They were going home together.

22:58.000 --> 23:03.080
Going home together?
Well, she's doing that homestay thing!

23:03.080 --> 23:04.740
But what about after?

23:06.910 --> 23:09.150
No, it can't be.

23:09.150 --> 23:11.180
Takagami lives with his dad,
so nothing should happen.

23:11.180 --> 23:13.550
Maybe they're not going straight home...

23:13.550 --> 23:16.320
No way, they're still in high school...

23:16.320 --> 23:17.950
But! But!

23:18.360 --> 23:19.790
What's wrong, Sakura?

23:19.890 --> 23:23.490
I need to know!

23:25.030 --> 23:25.400
Next Time

23:25.400 --> 23:31.370
Next Time
Though I live at the Takagami residence as a
Mamorime, I am the one placing them in danger.

23:31.370 --> 23:33.640
Next Time
I heard something about their
family budget being in danger.

23:33.640 --> 23:34.210
Next Time

23:34.210 --> 23:35.180
Next Time
Next time, "Our Fox Deity, Harvests."

23:35.180 --> 23:36.610
Next Time
Our Fox Deity, Harvests
Next time, "Our Fox Deity, Harvests."

23:36.610 --> 23:39.580
Next Time
Our Fox Deity, Harvests
I will do something about this,
even at the cost of my life.

23:39.580 --> 23:39.940
Next Time
Our Fox Deity, Harvests
